00:19:30,000 --> 00:19:36,000
In 1930s fascist Italy, adolescent Luca just lost his mother.

4
00:26:00,000 --> 00:26:06,000
His father, a callous businessman, sends him to be taken
care of by British expatriate Mary Wallace.

5
00:32:30,000 --> 00:32:36,000
Mary and her cultured friends - including artist Arabella, young widow Elsa,
and archaeologist Georgie - keep a watchful eye over the boy.

6
00:39:00,000 --> 00:39:06,000
But the women's cultivated lives take a dramatic turn when
Allied forces declare war on Mussolini.

